sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant RN as React Native App
  participant API as Medusa Tracking API
  participant WF as ingestLocationBatch Workflow
  participant Tracking as Tracking Module
  participant PG as PostgreSQL/PostGIS
  participant Redis as Redis Pub/Sub
  participant WS as WebSocket Gateway
  participant Web as Next.js Manager Dashboard
  RN->>API: POST /api/v1/tracking/location-batch
  API->>API: Validate token, tenant, device and rate limit
  API->>WF: Invoke with idempotency keys
  WF->>Tracking: Verify active work session
  Tracking->>PG: Insert deduplicated pings and last-known location
  WF->>Redis: Publish tracking.location.recorded
  Redis->>WS: Fan out tenant event
  WS->>WS: Filter by manager permissions/team
  WS-->>Web: Live rep location update
  API-->>RN: Accepted IDs and rejected IDs
